#. from libreoffice:desktop-messages
msgid "You can find a collection of extensions on the Web."
msgstr "Du kan hitta en samling tillägg på webben."

#. from libreoffice:desktop-messages
msgid "The Extension Manager adds, removes, disables, enables, and updates extensions."
msgstr "Tillägg lägger till, tar bort, inaktiverar, aktiverar och uppdaterar tillägg."

#. from libreoffice:desktop-messages
msgid "For whom do you want to install the extension?"
msgstr "För vem/vilka vill du installera tillägget?"

#. from libreoffice:desktop-messages
msgid "Make sure that no further users are working with the same %PRODUCTNAME, when installing an extension for all users in a multi user environment."
